37045>>>>>    Function IsLoggedIn Returns Boolean
37047>>>>>        String sLoginName
37047>>>>>        Boolean bLogWebSession bLoggedIn
37047>>>>>        
37047>>>>>        Get pbLogWebSession to bLogWebSession
37048>>>>>        If not bLogWebSession Begin
37050>>>>>            Forward Get IsLoggedIn to bLoggedIn
37052>>>>>            Function_Return bLoggedIn
37053>>>>>        End
