37056>>>>>    
37056>>>>>    
37056>>>>>    //
37056>>>>>    // This procedure is called when validating a session and after logging in. Its purpose is to 
37056>>>>>    // update properties based on the session and user data. Augment this function to update 
37056>>>>>    // properties based on the session / user table. Note that WebAppUser and WebAppSession contain
37056>>>>>    // the right records when this procedure is called.
37056>>>>>    //
37056>>>>>    // Params:
37056>>>>>    //      bClear   True if the procedure is called before session validation to clear properties.
37056>>>>>    //
37056>>>>>    Procedure UpdateSessionProperties Boolean bClear
37058>>>>>        Handle hoUserDD
37058>>>>>        
37058>>>>>        Get phoUserDD to hoUserDD
37059>>>>>        
37059>>>>>        //  Update user properties
37059>>>>>        If (not(bClear) and HasRecord(hoUserDD)) Begin
37061>>>>>            Set psUsername to (Trim(WebAppUser.FullName))
37062>>>>>            Set psLoginName to (Trim(WebAppUser.LoginName))
37063>>>>>            Set piUserRights to WebAppUser.Rights
37064>>>>>            
37064>>>>>            Send OnSessionPropertiesSet 
37065>>>>>        End
37065>>>>>>
37065>>>>>        Else Begin
37066>>>>>            Set psUsername to ""
37067>>>>>            Set psLoginName to ""
37068>>>>>            Set piUserRights to 0
37069>>>>>            
37069>>>>>            Send OnSessionPropertiesClear
37070>>>>>        End
37070>>>>>>
37070>>>>>    End_Procedure
37071>>>>>    
37071>>>>>    Procedure OnSessionPropertiesSet
37073>>>>>        //  Empty event stub
37073>>>>>    End_Procedure
37074>>>>>    
37074>>>>>    Procedure OnSessionPropertiesClear
37076>>>>>        //  Empty event stub
37076>>>>>    End_Procedure
37077>>>>>    
37077>>>>>    Procedure EndSession
37079>>>>>        Integer iErr
37079>>>>>        Boolean bLogWebSession
37079>>>>>        Handle hoSessionDD       
37079>>>>>        
37079>>>>>        Get phoSessionDD to hoSessionDD
37080>>>>>        Get pbLogWebSession to bLogWebSession
37081>>>>>        If not bLogWebSession Begin
37083>>>>>            Forward Send EndSession
37085>>>>>            Procedure_Return
37086>>>>>        End
37086>>>>>>
37086>>>>>            
37086>>>>>        //  Check if session exists
37086>>>>>        Send Clear of hoSessionDD
37087>>>>>        Get psSessionKey to WebAppSession.SessionKey
37088>>>>>        
37088>>>>>        Send Find of hoSessionDD EQ Index.1
37089>>>>>        If (Found) Begin
37091>>>>>            Set Field_Changed_Value of hoSessionDD Field WebAppSession.Active to "N"
37092>>>>>            Get Request_Validate of hoSessionDD to iErr
37093>>>>>            If (iErr) Begin
37095>>>>>                // this should not happen. If it does its a programming error
37095>>>>>                Error DFERR_PROGRAM C_$WebAppSessionValidateFailed
37096>>>>>>
37096>>>>>                Procedure_Return
37097>>>>>            End
37097>>>>>>
37097>>>>>            Send Request_Save of hoSessionDD
37098>>>>>        End
37098>>>>>>
37098>>>>>    End_Procedure
37099>>>>>
37099>>>>>End_Class
37100>>>>>
